### Lista svih monitora
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitors

### Jedan monitor
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitors/1

### Kreiraj monitor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring",
  "url": "https://spring.io",
  "intervalSeconds": 120
}

### Kreiraj monitor (bez intervala)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wikipedia",
  "url": "https://www.wikipedia.org"
}

### Kreiraj monitor (neispravno)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "url": "ovo-nije-url",
  "intervalSeconds": 1
}